---
// Rejilla discontinua de fondo: 2 columnas en móvil, 4 en escritorio
---

<div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 z-0">
	<div class="container-page grid h-full grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4">
		{
			[0, 1, 2, 3].map((i) => (
				<div class:list={['border-l border-dashed border-ink/10', i >= 2 && 'hidden md:block', i === 3 && 'border-r']} />
			))
		}
	</div>
</div>
